    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A novel game where a rabbit girl and various characters spend time together.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[\u2605Synopsis\u2605]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character, Kosuke Tamaki, has advanced to his second year of high school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He finds an injured rabbit while walking in the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When I took him home and let him rest, what was the person standing in front of me the next morning?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please enjoy the relaxing daily life of the characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play time will be approximately 1 hour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010\u2605Rest House\u2605\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >scenario:Mov Ken</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >illustration:Kinakousa</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[\u2605Voice actor\u2605]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yukino Suzuka</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furugori</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[\u2605Composer of the music used\u2605]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rabbit shop music room</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharou</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ucchii0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[\u2605Author of background material used\u2605]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minchirie</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*The characters, organizations, names, etc. that appear are fictitious and have nothing to do with reality.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A novel game where a rabbit girl and various characters spend time together.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[\u2605Synopsis\u2605]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character, Kosuke Tamaki, has advanced to his second year of high school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He finds an injured rabbit while walking in the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When I took him home and let him rest, what was the person standing in front of me the next morning?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please enjoy the relaxing daily life of the characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play time will be approximately 1 hour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010\u2605Rest House\u2605\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >scenario:Mov Ken</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >illustration:Kinakousa</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[\u2605Voice actor\u2605]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yukino Suzuka</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furugori</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[\u2605Composer of the music used\u2605]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rabbit shop music room</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharou</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ucchii0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[\u2605Author of background material used\u2605]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minchirie</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*The characters, organizations, names, etc. that appear are fictitious and have nothing to do with reality.</p>",
